{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21271","headline":"酬乐天赴江州路上见寄三首 三 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天赴江州路上见寄三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人亦有相爱，我尔殊衆人。\n朝朝宁不食，日日愿见君。\n一日不得见，愁肠坐氛氲。\n如何远相失，各作万里云。\n云高风苦多，会合难遽因。\n天上犹有碍，何况地上身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}